<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>肾水 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E8%82%BE%E6%B0%B4/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Sat, 13 Jun 2026 14:23:22 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E8%82%BE%E6%B0%B4/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>抑治法：论肺火心火胃火肝火肾水</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/4-18-yizhifa/</link><pubDate>Sun, 07 Jun 2026 09:15:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/4-18-yizhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E5%9B%9B%E5%BE%A1%E9%9B%86/">卷四御集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“抑治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;肺、心、胃、肝四经火旺及肾水泛滥&lt;/strong&gt;的抑制法则。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;抑之使不旺。火盛不可纯用苦寒直折，当分别脏腑特性，或以轻清抑肺，或以泻母平心，或以补肾制胃，或以和解抑肝，务使火降而正不伤&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item><item><title>肾水篇第二十六</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-26/</link><pubDate>Sat, 06 Dec 2025 12:22:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-26/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%A4%96%E7%BB%8F/">外经</category><description>文章通过少师与岐伯的对话，极深刻地剖析了&lt;strong&gt;肾水&lt;/strong&gt;在人体五行生克中的核心地位，阐述了肺肾关系、水火既济的机制，以及“肾有补无泻”的理论依据。</description></item></channel></rss>